---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  description="About Petauron, the origin of its name, and how the organization builds open-source software with AI."
  locale="en"
  title="About"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="page-hero__title">About Petauron.</h1><p class="page-hero__copy">
        Petauron is an open-source technology organization that builds practical software with
        AI capabilities.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container about-grid">
      <div class="about-grid__aside"><span>Why the name</span></div><article class="prose">
        <p>
          Petauron is a coined name derived from the sugar glider's scientific name, <a
            href="https://australian.museum/learn/animals/mammals/sugar-glider/"
            rel="noreferrer"
            target="_blank"><i lang="la">Petaurus breviceps</i></a
          >. It keeps the <em>Petaur-</em> stem and adds the ending <em>-on</em>.
        </p><h2>Built with AI</h2><p>
          Every Petauron project is built with AI capabilities. AI writes and reviews
          substantial portions of the code. We also evaluate and adopt useful new technologies.
        </p><h2>Open-source by default</h2><p>
          Open-source code lets people inspect implementation, report problems, and improve
          tools together. Sensitive information remains private; important public decisions
          should be documented when practical.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 15rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    max-width: 1080px;
  }
  .about-grid__aside {
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--accent);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 720;
    letter-spacing: 0.11em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
